WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.500
[Narration] In a quiet village nestled between emerald hills, the monsoon had arrived with a song of rain and thunder.

2
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:28.500
Gauri: The rains will nourish our harvest this year, my child.

3
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:55.500
[Narration] Midnight came with a violent gale. And with the cold wind came an unexpected peril for the little one.

4
00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:18.500
Gauri: Aarav... wake up my darling. Oh God, your forehead is burning like fire!

5
00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:45.500
[Narration] With the village path submerged under floodwaters, a mother's wisdom and courage became the only medicine.

6
00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:08.500
Gauri: Hold on, my little angel. Mother is right here with you. Nothing will happen to you.

7
00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:35.500
[Narration] Hour after hour, she remained motionless beside the cradle, fighting sleep and despair with every breath.

8
00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:58.500
Gauri: Sleep peacefully, my baby. The storm will pass soon.

9
00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:25.500
[Narration] As the tempest surrendered to stillness, the burning heat subsided. Life and hope bloomed anew.

10
00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:48.500
Gauri: You did it, my brave little warrior! Thank you, God, thank you!

11
00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:15.500
[Narration] The monsoon had washed the world clean. Under the warm morning sun, love stood triumphant over every storm.

12
00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:38.500
Gauri: Look Aarav, see how beautiful the world is today!
